    "notes": "<p>Device access levels:</p><p></p><p>Infiltrate actions:</p><table><tbody><tr><td><p>Enable or Disable</p></td><td><p>Turn the device on or off</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Access logs</p></td><td><p>Access how this device was used recently</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Monitor data</p></td><td><p>Monitor the data being generated by this device</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Access unprotected files</p></td><td><p>Access any unprotected files on the device</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p>Control actions:</p><table><tbody><tr><td><p>Control device</p></td><td><p>You can spotlight an action to make this device do anything within its capabilites. Spend 1 Hope and make a Spellcasting (Hacking) check to determine the quality of the outcome</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Access protected files</p></td><td><p>Access all files on the device</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Alter data</p></td><td><p>Describe the data you wish to alter - Spend 1 Hope and make a Spellcasting (Hacking) check to determine the quality of the outcome</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Detonate</p></td><td><p>d4 damage to all creatures within Very Close. Make a Reaction check against this device's Difficulty to take half damage.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Send Message </p></td><td><p>Cause the device to emit a message to all subscribed devices and personnel</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
